// «N» calls that each WRITE one cell of a module's state of «N» cells — the
// shape of a module with an API (`tablero::poner(i, v)`). Linear when a call
// costs what the cell costs; quadratic when it costs the size of the state.
<# ./mod/mesa => M
M::crear(«N»)
@ k:1..«N» { M::poner((k % «N») + 1, k) }
>> M::leer(1) + M::cuanto() ¶
